<body>
    <h1>Calculating profile completeness</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"76fe7e7a6e95">Assuming you mean <strong>competitors<=
/strong>, I checked <strong>Europass, Indeed, </strong><a class=3D"external=
-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"http://Resume.io" local-id=
=3D"1bdf4907a49f" rel=3D"nofollow">http://Resume.io</a> <strong> and Kickre=
sume</strong>. Below is a consolidated field inventory; availability varies=
 by platform. Detailed subfields are a synthesis of their documentation, no=
t an exhaustive audit of every live form.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8a0b215c41b8"><strong>CV content fields</strong></p>
