<p local-id=3D"d7fbe7ff8e81"><a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearanc=
e=3D"inline" href=3D"http://Resume.io" local-id=3D"6278eb0e35f4" rel=3D"nof=
ollow">http://Resume.io</a> documents personal details, summary, links, emp=
loyment, education, skills and extra sections. Europass supports experience=
, education/training, languages, digital skills, projects and achievements.=
 Kickresume also supports optional awards, publications, references, social=
 links and custom sections. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://help=
.resume.io/en/articles/3785152" rel=3D"nofollow">Resume.io</a>, <a class=3D=
"external-link" href=3D"https://europass.europa.eu/en/how-complete-my-europ=
ass-profile" rel=3D"nofollow">Europass</a>, <a class=3D"external-link" href=
=3D"https://www.kickresume.com/en/resumes/" rel=3D"nofollow">Kickresume</a>=
</p>
