<p local-id=3D"35e10196a5f0">These are profile/preferences fields rather th=
an mandatory CV sections. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://www.in=
deed.com/career-advice/finding-a-job/how-to-optimize-indeed-profile" rel=3D=
"nofollow">Indeed profile documentation</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"474d94b17560">For <strong>CareerPilot=E2=80=99s demo</strong=
>, I would start with <strong>contact details, experience, education, skill=
s, languages, target roles, location preferences and availability</strong>.=
 Keep the other sections optional, and let projects or volunteering provide=
 evidence for students without formal work experience.</p>
